<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">ABOUT MICROPLEX</span><h1>Technology shaped around people and progress.</h1><p>We are a Sri Lankan software company with an international outlook, creating practical digital products for businesses and public environments.</p></div></section>
<section class="section-space"><div class="container"><div class="row g-5 align-items-center"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="section-kicker">WHO WE ARE</span><h2 class="section-title">Local understanding.<br />Global perspective.</h2></div><div class="col-lg-6"><p class="about-copy">Microplex Corporation operates from Anuradhapura, Sri Lanka, with a branch office in Atsugi, Kanagawa Prefecture, Japan. That connection gives us a distinct perspective: close collaboration, disciplined delivery, and technology designed for diverse markets.</p><p class="about-copy">Our work spans enterprise resource planning, point-of-sale platforms, digital advertising networks, financial technology, artificial intelligence, and machine learning.</p></div></div><div class="row g-4 mt-5"><div class="col-md-4"><div class="value-card"><span>01</span><h3>Practical by design</h3><p>We solve operational problems with clear, usable software.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="value-card"><span>02</span><h3>Built to evolve</h3><p>Our systems are designed to grow with changing organizations.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="value-card"><span>03</span><h3>Connected thinking</h3><p>We bring business, data, screens, and intelligence together.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="intro-section section-space"><div class="container"><div class="row align-items-end mb-5"><div class="col-lg-7"><span class="section-kicker">WHAT WE DELIVER</span><h2 class="section-title">Four pillars.<br />One engineering team.</h2></div><div class="col-lg-5"><p class="section-lead">Every product we build fits into a broader system — designed to work together, not in isolation.</p></div></div><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><article class="solution-card"><span class="card-number">01</span><h3>Business Systems</h3><p>ERP and POS platforms built around the way your teams actually work.</p><span class="card-tag">ERP · POS</span></article></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><article class="solution-card accent-cyan"><span class="card-number">02</span><h3>Digital Experiences</h3><p>Content and advertising systems for screens wherever attention happens.</p><span class="card-tag">DISPLAY · MEDIA</span></article></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><article class="solution-card accent-violet"><span class="card-number">03</span><h3>Financial Technology</h3><p>Secure software designed to bring clarity and control to financial operations.</p><span class="card-tag">FINTECH</span></article></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><article class="solution-card accent-coral"><span class="card-number">04</span><h3>Applied Intelligence</h3><p>AI and machine learning solutions focused on useful, measurable outcomes.</p><span class="card-tag">AI · ML</span></article></div></div></div></section>
